      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riali ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ rɔ ikä kɛ ko̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ben raar, kä Daan kä Ber-cɛ-ba, amäni mun Gil-yad. Kä cu nɛy diaal rɔ dol kɛɛl nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kä Midh-pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu bööth diaal thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal gua̱thkiɛn ka̱n rɛy dolä nɛɛni Kuɔth. Kä cu nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kur ŋuaan cua yio̱w kööriɛn ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min ɛ liŋ i̱ ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wä kä Midh-pa.) Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wee, “Läri jɛ kɔ, ɛn nɛ jiääk ɛmɛ bëë i̱di?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan ji̱ Lii-bay min la cɔw ciek in ca luc ɛ loc wëë i̱, “Ɣän cä ben kä Giba wec ji̱ Ben-ya-min, kɔnɛ luɔmdä, kɛ ɣöö ba̱kɔ niɛɛn thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Giba ben kɔɔrä cua duel ben go̱l kɛ wäär. Go̱o̱r kɛn näkdä, kä cukɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ luɔmdä, amäni mëë cɛ li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ puɔ̱ny lomädä ka̱n kä cua̱ jɛ ŋuɔ̱k dhoon, Kä cua̱ thok duëëlɔ cu jäk ikä kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. Kɛ ɣöö ca mi jiääk mi ci rɔ lot la̱t rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ yɛn diaal yɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Latdɛ ruacdun, kɛnɛ ŋukdun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal rɔ jiɛc kɛɛl wäkɛ i̱, “Thilɛ ram mi bi loc cieŋ kä kɔ, thilɛ ram mi bi loc dhɔɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛmɛ ɛ Jɛn min ba̱kɔ lät kä ji̱ Giba. Ba̱kɔ jɛ ka̱p ko̱r kɛ yor gaakni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba wutni wäl ka̱n kä nɛy ti kuɔ̱r thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. Kä ba nɛy ti kuɔ̱r ka̱n kä nɛy ti bathdɔɔr, kä ba nɛy ti bathdɔɔr ka̱n kä nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl, bikɛ naath moc mi̱eth. Kä duɔth nath bikɛ Giba wec ji̱ Ben-ya-min wä ma̱k, kɛ kui̱ jiäkni diaal tin ci kɛn kɛ la̱t kä I-thɛ-rɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ dol kɛɛl kɛn diaal kɛ mäk wec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal nath jäk kä thok duëël ji̱ Ben-ya-min wäkɛ i̱, “Ɛ mi jiääk mi tëë di ɛ nɛ ci tuɔɔk rɛydun ɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ŋuɔ̱nɛ nɛy tɔ̱ jiäk tɔ̱ la̱tkɛ nɔmɔ tɔ̱ kä Giba, kɛ ɣöö dëë kɔ kɛ ben näk. Kä dëë mi jiääk ɛmɛ cu woc rɛy I-thɛ-rɛl.” Kä duundɛ ɣöö /ken ji̱ Ben-ya-min ruac ganmani, ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec Ben-ya-min ben raar wi̱i̱nikiɛn duɔlkɛ rɔ kä Giba, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ëë cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn rɛw wi̱cdɛ bäkɛl cɔl rɛy wi̱i̱nikiɛn kɛɛl kɛ yio̱w kööriɛn, a ci ji̱ Giba ti kur bärɔw ti ca kuany te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy tɔ̱tɔ̱ diaal te rɛydiɛn kɛ nɛy ti kur bärɔw ti cäm ti ca kuany. Kɛ ra̱ŋ ti ca miem duer kɛ döl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl a /ci ji̱ Ben-ya-min te thi̱n, cua nɛy ti ji̱ ko̱o̱r ti bathdɔɔri ti kur ŋuaan kuany.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱r kɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ jiɛc wäkɛ kä Beth-ɛl, cukɛ Kuoth wä thiec i̱, “Ɛŋa kä nɛy bi wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ nhiam ɔ?” Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ thok duëël Juda bi wä mɔ kɛ nhiam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ jiɛc nikɛ runwaŋ, kä cukɛ ben pua̱t lotdä Giba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min. Kä cukɛ tuɔ̱ŋ ko̱o̱r kuany thiekä Giba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min pua̱t raar Giba, kä cua ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn rɛw wi̱cdɛ rɛw näk ɛn cäŋ ɛ mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ bum, cukɛ tuɔ̱ŋ ko̱o̱r nyɔk kɛ cuɔ̱ŋ niɛ guäth ëë ci kɛn kɛ kɔn cuŋ thi̱n kɛ cäŋ ëë nhiam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wä wiee nhiam Kuɔth Nhial amäni thiaŋ. Kä cukɛ Kuoth Nhial thiec i̱, “Ba̱kɔ rɔ nyɔk kɛ wä ko̱o̱r kä gaatmanikɔ ni ji̱ Ben-ya-min?” Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ loc i̱, “Wiaa nyiëënyɛ kɛ kɛ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Wiaa nyiëënyɛ kɛ kɛ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛn cio̱k ɛ mi bëë kɛ thiaŋ kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn ta̱a̱ ciökni kɛ luɔtdiɛn.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ko̱r wä tɛ̈r kɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ cäŋ in rɛwdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min ben kä kɛ raar Giba kɛ cäŋ in rɛwdɛ, kä cukɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl bädäk ti ji̱ ko̱o̱r kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal wä pua̱t kä Beth-ɛl kä cukɛ wiee. Cukɛ nyuur ɛn wi̱ni nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, Kä /ken kɛ mi̱th ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ amäni thiaŋ. Kä cukɛ muc tin waŋkɛ kɛ muc malä thöp nhiam Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl Kuoth Nhial thiec (kɛ ɣöö te thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth ɛn wi̱ni kɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä lätni Pi-nɛ-ɣath gat Ɛl-a-dhar gat Ä-ron nhiamdɛ ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱) wäkɛ i̱, “Kɔn bakɔ rɔ̱ nyɔk kɛ ko̱r kɛ gaatmanikɔ ni ji̱ Ben-ya-min, kiɛ /cakɔ bi wä?” Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ loc i̱, “Wiaakɛ, kɛ ɣöö iruun bäkɛ la̱th tetädun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl naath wä nyurikä gekä Giba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ji̱ Ben-ya-min ma̱k kɛ cäŋ in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn, kä cukɛ tuɔ̱ŋkiɛn cuŋ lotdä Giba ce̱tkɛ ni̱n tëë wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min ben raar kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cikɛ ben raar rɛy wec ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ in wen. Cukɛ jɛ tok kɛ mi näk kɛn tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl dɛɛkä wec, duɔ̱pni tin di̱t. Tin wä kɛl kä Beth-ɛl, kä wä min dɔ̱ŋ kä Giba. Cukɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ti jiɛn diɔ̱k näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min wee, “Banɛ kɛ joc kɛ juc in wen.” Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wee, “Bar nɛ rɔ, na̱a̱nɛ kɛ kɛ wec wanɛ duɔ̱pni tin di̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal rɔ guath jɔk gua̱thnikiɛn, kä cukɛ rɔ wä car kä Baal-ta-mar. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin ci naath nyurikä ben raar gua̱thnikiɛn tin ca rɔ̱ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ thi̱n gekä Giba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl ti ca liny kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal Giba ma̱k. Mëë ci ko̱r leeth. Kä kui̱c ji̱ Ben-ya-min ɛ ɛn ɣöö ci riɛk ben kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ Ben-ya-min jak kä juɔckɛ ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec wi̱i̱diɛn kuɔ̱r kɛl kä ji̱ Ben-ya-min näk ɛn cäŋ ëë. Ti kɛn diaal wutni ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min jɛ car ɛn ɣöö ca ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl joc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duɔ̱p in joc ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ji̱ Ben-ya-min gueny gua̱a̱th, kɛ ɣöö ŋääth kɛn nɛy tin ca kɛ nyurikä, tin ca la̱th gekä Giba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy tin ca naath nyurikä riŋ rɛy Giba kɛ pɛ̈th. Kä cukɛ däk rɛy wec kä cukɛ ji̱ wec diaal näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu nyuuth kam nɛɛni tin ca nath nyurikä kɛnɛ buɔ̱n ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl in te ko̱o̱r. Cua ɣöö mi wa tol nɛn wëë nhial rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ bi ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl cu loc ko̱o̱r. Kä täämɛ ci ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ ku thuŋ näk nɛy ti jiɛn diɔ̱k, kɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cukɛ wee, “Jooc kɔn kɛ ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ in wen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci nyuuth rɔ tok kɛ mi jɔcɛ, cu tol päl wi̱c. Cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min liɛc jɔɔkdiɛn. Kä nɛnɛ ci wec kɛɛliw tolɛ pith ni pua̱a̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ riet kɛ, kä cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ci riɛk ben kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cukɛ rɔ bar nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl barkɛ rɔ̱ dɔɔr. Ɛ ni ɣöö ka̱n rɔ luäŋ kɛ leny, cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin bä wi̱i̱ni kɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min go̱l, kä cukɛ kɛ joc kä na̱kɛ kɛ a räth ni lotdä Giba kui̱ käny ca̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl bädäk näk kä ji̱ Ben-ya-min. Kɛn diaal kɛ ji̱ ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ rɔ bar rɛy dɔaar pa̱a̱m Ri-mon. Cua nɛy ti bathdɔɔri dhieec kä kɛ thum duɔ̱pni tin di̱t, cuakɛ joc ɛlɔ̱ŋ amäni Gi-dom, kä cua nɛy ti bathdɔɔri rɛw näk kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu nɛy diaal tëë ci li̱w ɛn cäŋ ëë kä ji̱ Ben-ya-min a nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec, ti kɛn diaal ji̱ ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy ti kur bäkɛl rɔ bar rɛy dɔaar pääm Ri-mon, kä cukɛ rɔ wä tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ rɛy pa̱a̱m Ri-mon kɛ päth ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ ri̱t jucä ji̱ Ben-ya-min, kä cukɛ kɛ näk, naath kɛ lëy kɛ tin diaal tin ci kɛn kɛ jek. Kä wi̱i̱ diaal cua kɛ cua̱th kɛ mac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
